%% UC-29 — Run daily backup (cron 02:00)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CR as Cron (backup-service)
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant N4 as Neo4j
    participant FU as Fuseki
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant FS as Backup volume
    participant WH as Alert webhook

    CR->>M: mongodump --archive
    M-->>CR: dump stream
    CR->>N4: neo4j-admin database dump
    N4-->>CR: graph dump
    CR->>FU: tar fuseki-data
    FU-->>CR: archive
    CR->>KC: POST /partial-export (realm hhh)
    KC-->>CR: realm JSON
    CR->>FS: Write timestamped archives
    CR->>FS: Prune backups older than 30 days
    alt any step failed
        CR->>WH: POST failure alert (ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL)
    end
